---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="For shops & show organizers" description="Run a Pokémon league, card shop or card show near Austin? Get listed on Card Night for free.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Run a shop, league, or show near Austin?</h1>
    <p class="lede">Card Night helps Austin families find kid-friendly places to play and buy Pokémon cards. Basic listings are free. We'd love accurate info straight from you.</p>
    <h2>Free listing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Add your store, league night, or show, or correct an existing listing.</li>
      <li>Send us your current Pokémon schedule, entry fee, and whether younger kids are welcome.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Featured spots (coming later)</h2>
    <p>Later we plan to offer clearly labeled featured spots on the homepage and in the weekly email, for example to promote a prerelease, League Cup, or show weekend. Featured placement will always be marked as sponsored, and it will never change our parent notes.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="mailto:justintorch@mail.grokbot.com?subject=Card%20Night%20listing">Email us about a listing</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
